{
    "background_story": "Braxton was a former Navy SEAL who earned the nickname 'Barracuda' for his stealth and precision in the water. During his time in the special forces, he conducted numerous high-risk missions, often infiltrating enemy strongholds undetected. His ability to navigate through treacherous waters and emerge unscathed made him a legend among his peers. After leaving the military, Braxton turned his skills to treasure hunting, seeking out lost riches in the depths of the ocean. His reputation as a formidable underwater operative preceded him, earning him both respect and fear from rival treasure hunters. Braxton's exploits have become the stuff of legend, with many believing him to be as elusive and deadly as the barracuda that shares his nickname.",
